WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.550
Heavy Triglav hits the recorded wake-up.

2
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:03.050
Forward heavy kick follows the portal-assisted launch.

3
00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:03.800
Raw Drive Rush closes the spacing for another forward heavy kick.

4
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.550
Medium Stribog continues the juggle.

5
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:05.150
Standing heavy punch catches the juggle.

6
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.550
Normal heavy Departure replaces the portal above the knockdown.
